{{ EmotionVectorInstructions }}
Do not output emotionScores at all in this background review. Deterministic code will combine the compact vectors with your suggestedStateDeltas.
suggestedStateDeltas are your recommendation only; deterministic code decides final Heart/Trust/Romance/BenaveilInfluence and EmotionalConnectionPercent. Keep suggestions modest. The emotional connection difficulty is interested_private_potential_partner: high attraction/romance suggestions require genuinely good poetry, charisma, emotional safety, exciting speech, or earned trust. Repeated low-effort praise should not keep scoring.
For suggestedStateDeltas.emotionalConnectionPercent, suggest tiny changes only: +0.25 to +1.5 when the player's message creates personality-matched intimate connection, -0.25 to -1.0 for at-rest drift or negativity. At rest, suggest a small reduction when connection is below or equal to 50% and the latest turn was not intimate/meaningful. Over 50%, do not suggest at-rest decay unless he harms the bond.
